<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5628] .NET: incorrect jvm.dll lookup paths for JRE</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5628</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;jvm.dll&lt;/tt&gt; is located in different subfolders in JRE and JDK. Current code only accounts for JDK. So if we set &lt;tt&gt;JAVA_HOME&lt;/tt&gt; to a custom xcopy-deployed JRE folder, jvm.dll can not be found.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;With normal Windows installations it works because we use registry for that.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
